From: SteamPhone Project <steamphone@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] arm64: dts: qcom: Add SteamPhone base device tree include
Date: Mon, 1 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
Signed-off-by: SteamPhone Project <steamphone@example.com>
---

This patch adds a base include file for SteamPhone device trees.

Note: This is a STUB patch for build infrastructure.
Actual device tree definitions need hardware investigation.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/steamphone-base.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/steamphone-base.dtsi
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1234567
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/steamphone-base.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+/*
+ * SteamPhone base device tree include
+ * Common hardware definitions for SteamPhone devices
+ */
+
+/ {
+	/* SteamPhone specific properties */
+	steamphone {
+		compatible = "steamphone,base";
+		model = "SteamPhone ARM Gaming Device";
+	};
+
+	chosen {
+		/* Bootlogo - needs actual firmware */
+		bootloader-version = "SteamPhone 1.0";
+	};
+};
